# CSCI 159 Lab 3 – Functions

## Description
This lab focuses on designing and implementing reusable C++ functions to calculate volumes, surface areas, and required quantities for barrels and concrete pads. The program prompts the user for input, calls functions to compute results, and outputs the information in a structured and safe manner.

---

## Installation
To compile and run the program:

```bash
g++ -Wall Lab3a.cpp -o Lab3
./Lab3
