Your program will:
• Describe what the program will do.
• Prompt the user for volume of water needed (in L).
• Prompt the user for the height and radius of their barrels (in cm).
• Prompt the user for the desired height of their concrete pads (in cm).
• Use a function to compute and return the volume of the barrel (in L).
• Use a function to output the surface area of the pads (in cm?).
• Use functions to compute and output the number of barrels required.
• Use a function to compute and return the volume of the pads (in L).
